sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Original Grove driver
    participant R1 as Full Ravel 1.1.0 keg
    participant F as Finish in Claude Code
    participant N as Frozen native plugin cache
    participant B as One backup
    participant H as Real HOME
    participant R2 as Promoted Ravel 2.0.0
    D->>R1: Launch finish through policy.ts
    R1->>F: Original mandate and ending
    F->>N: Read finish guidance by absolute path
    F->>F: Release Grove, verify pair, promote Ravel
    F->>F: Owner checklist and narrow process check
    F->>B: Copy and verify all planned original items
    Note over F,H: Finish waits; no settings action or other writer
    F->>H: Off value, then disabled hook installation
    F->>H: Deactivate native copies; activate Ravel last
    F->>R2: Resolve and run both harness probes
    R2-->>F: Observed reads and hooks
    F->>N: Reread guidance and compare registrations
    alt Probes and final comparisons pass
        F->>H: Verified receipt and manual entry
        F->>R1: Exact original ending command
    else Any failure after backup
        B->>H: Full native restore, Ravel sources off
        F->>F: Verify native return and stop without success
    end
    Note over D,R1: No cleanup until the original driver's reap
    Note over B,H: A crash needs explicit restore after restart
